I made this demo to study ray tracing using only the `CPU`.

To learn about ray tracing, I used many resources, such as:
- [The classic Ray Tracing in One Weekend](https://raytracing.github.io/)
- [Sebastian Lague's video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qz0KTGYJtUk)
- [Keenan Crane's course in computer graphics](http://15462.courses.cs.cmu.edu/fall2021/)
	- [Slides](http://15462.courses.cs.cmu.edu/fall2021/lecture/renderingequation)
	- [Video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ttxdbn7TSLI)

Then I integrated some parts into [tela.js](https://pedroth.github.io/tela.js).

![3D/2D ray tracing demo](/posts/RayTraceDemo/RayTraceDemo.mp4)

Check out the project below.

